<body>

<div class="page">
  <h1>JAMIA HAMDARD KANNUR CAMPUS</h1>
  <p>
    <span data-field="paragraph_1">Jamia Hamdard Kannur Campus located in the state of {{ state }} is the first constituent unit and the only one of its kind established by {{ founder_name }} in {{ founding_year }}. The formal inauguration of the Campus was held on {{ inauguration_date }}.</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <span data-field="paragraph_2">The Kannur Campus came into being because of the tremendous efforts taken by {{ key_figure }}. {{ key_figure }} whose foresight and vision resulted in this Campus, where he selflessly channeled his personal efforts for the cause of education to all. He had the conviction that it was the only way to bring sustained betterment to the society, particularly the marginalized sections of Muslim community in North Malabar.</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <span data-field="paragraph_3">Jamia Hamdard Kannur Campus is ideally located in the heart of Kannur City, which is conducive for academic, intellectual and physical pursuits. The Campus is located very near to {{ landmark_1 }} and {{ landmark_2 }} and only a few kilometers away from {{ landmark_3 }} Railway Station, {{ landmark_4 }} Bus Stand, {{ landmark_5 }} University, {{ landmark_6 }} Campus, and {{ landmark_7 }} Beach.</span>
  </p>
  <h2 class="section-title">PROGRAMMES OF STUDY</h2>
  <p>
    <span data-field="programmes_summary">Jamia Hamdard Kannur Campus offers programmes of study in the field of {{ field_1 }}, {{ field_2 }}, {{ field_3 }} and {{ field_4 }}. The following are the programmes offered:</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Undergraduate Programmes:</strong>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="ug_programme_1">{{ ug_programme_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="ug_programme_2">{{ ug_programme_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="ug_programme_3">{{ ug_programme_3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="ug_programme_4">{{ ug_programme_4 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="ug_programme_5">{{ ug_programme_5 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="ug_programme_6">{{ ug_programme_6 }}</span></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>Postgraduate Programme</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><span data-field="pg_programme_1">{{ pg_programme_1 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24px;">NON-TEACHING STAFF</h1>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>SL. NO</th>
        <th>Name of the Staff</th>
        <th>Designation</th>
        <th>Qualification</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for staff in non_teaching_staff %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="non_teaching_staff[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ staff.name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="non_teaching_staff[{{ loop.index0 }}].designation">{{ staff.designation }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="non_teaching_staff[{{ loop.index0 }}].qualification">{{ staff.qualification }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h1 style="font-size: 24px;">TEACHING STAFF</h1>
  <p>List of Contractual Faculties</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>SL.NO</th>
        <th>Name of the faculty</th>
        <th>Department</th>
        <th>Qualification</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for faculty in teaching_staff %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="teaching_staff[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ faculty.name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="teaching_staff[{{ loop.index0 }}].department">{{ faculty.department }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="teaching_staff[{{ loop.index0 }}].qualification">{{ faculty.qualification }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24px;">List of Guest Faculties</h1>
